<h1>About 0stakes</h1>

<p>
  0stakes is a free browser-based practice site for casino table games. <b>No real money
  is ever involved</b> — there's no wagering, no payouts, no way to deposit or withdraw
  anything. Craps, Blackjack, Roulette, and Baccarat are live.
</p>

<h2>Why it exists</h2>
<p>
  Learning a casino game usually means learning it with real money on the table, at
  real speed, from a dealer who isn't going to pause and explain the math. 0stakes is
  the opposite: every payout is the correct, published payout, every rule is stated
  plainly, and you can play as many rounds as you want for free while it sinks in.
  No ads, no account, no house tricks buried in the fine print.
</p>

<h2>How it's built</h2>
<p>
  Every part of this site — the game logic, the odds math, the layout — was built
  through plain-language conversation with a large language model, without a developer
  writing code by hand. Read the full story on
  <a href="/the-pit/built-by-an-llm/">how this site was made</a>.
</p>

<h2>If gambling is a problem</h2>
<p>
  0stakes is practice only and never involves real money, but if gambling elsewhere is
  a problem for you or someone you know, help is available: call 1-800-GAMBLER or visit
  <a href="https://www.ncpgambling.org" rel="noopener">ncpgambling.org</a>.
</p>

